{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "34", "UID": 20034, "OID": 20034.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Right then, that is all we have from this game. The annoying rain has dampened our spirits here, but there are still two games to go in this series.\u00a0The 2nd ODI will be played on 8th January, Monday at 2.30 pm IST (9.00 am GMT), but as you know, you can join us early for the build-up that will begin much sooner. Until then, take care and goodbye!", "Timestamp": "2024-01-06T15:59:54+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "33", "UID": 20033, "OID": 20033.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Earlier in the game, after opting to bat first, Sri Lanka were dealt an early blow in the form of Avishka Fernando in the first over. Despite the fall of an early wicket, Kusal Mendis\u00a0and Sadeera Samarawickrama\u00a0did not shy away from playing their shots and kept finding boundaries at regular intervals. However, Sadeera failed to make his start count, while Mendis was run out on 46. Despite the fall of wickets at regular intervals, Charith Asalanka kept going and, by doing so, kept Sri Lanka afloat. At 203-7, the Lankans were in danger of being bowled out inside the 50 overs, but Asalanka held his composure and soon brought up his third ODI hundred. He found an able alley in Dushmantha Chameera, and due to their 52-run stand, the hosts were able to reach 273, which looked unlikely at one stage. On the other hand, Zimbabwe gave a good account of themselves with the ball and kept Sri Lanka in check for most parts. However, they faced stiff resistance from Charith Asalanka, and bowlers struggling with cramps made matters worse for them. In pursuit of 274, Zimbabwe\u00a0were off to a shaky start as Tinashe Kamunhukamwe\u00a0and Craig Ervine\u00a0perished without troubling the scorers inside 4 overs. For Sri Lanka, Dilshan Madushanka\u00a0set the tone with a probing first over while his new ball partner, Dushmantha Chameera\u00a0backed it up from the other end. It was Madushanka who accounted for both wickets and looked hungry for more until the rain arrived.", "Timestamp": "2024-01-06T15:55:05+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "32", "UID": 20032, "OID": 20032.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE - 9.19 pm IST (3.49 pm GMT) - The inevitable has happened! THE MATCH HAS BEEN CALLED OFF! The forecast was always for rain, but we hoped that we could squeeze in at least 20 overs in the second innings, but it wasn't to be. Before the rain arrived, Sri Lanka\u00a0had their tails up and looked to be on course to take the lead in the series but the\u00a0rain played spoilsport. On the other hand, Zimbabwe had their backs against the wall and\u00a0will feel that they have gotten out of jail.", "Timestamp": "2024-01-06T15:49:46+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "31", "UID": 20031, "OID": 20031.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE - 8.45 pm IST (3.15 pm GMT) - The wait is still on! It continues to\u00a0rain\u00a0in Colombo and at this rate, the chances of the match to resume are very low. The cut-off time for a 20-over run chase is 10.10 pm IST (4.40 pm GMT). Stick around and let's remain hopeful for some positive news.", "Timestamp": "2024-01-06T15:15:52+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "30", "UID": 20030, "OID": 20030.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE - 8.14\u00a0pm IST (2.44\u00a0pm GMT) - The waiting game continues! Considering the amount of time lost so far, we might start losing overs soon, if not already.\u00a0All we can do right now is wait and hope for the rain to subside. Stick around for more news.", "Timestamp": "2024-01-06T14:44:22+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "29", "UID": 20029, "OID": 20029.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE -\u00a07.41 pm IST (2.11 pm GMT) - The rain continues to fall at the R Premadasa Stadium! The intensity of rain has increased but\u00a0as they do in this part of the world, the entire ground has been covered.\u00a0Let's keep our fingers crossed that the weather clears up soon for the action to resume. Stay tuned for further updates.", "Timestamp": "2024-01-06T14:11:48+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "28", "UID": 20028, "OID": 20028.0, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "UPDATE - 7.10 pm IST (1.40 pm GMT) - The covers are coming on\u00a0and the players are walking off the field. The rain gods have made their appearance. The umpires are more concerned because there is a bit of lightning around as well. The play has stopped with Zimbabwe\u00a012/2 after 4 overs chasing 274. Stay tuned and stick around, it might just be a passing shower.", "Timestamp": "2024-01-06T13:40:27+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.6", "Id": "27", "UID": 20027, "OID": 20027.0, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "5,203,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58065", "Bowler_Name": "Dushmantha Chameera", "Batsman": "66036", "Batsman_Name": "Milton Shumba", "Batsman_Style": "L", "Commentary": "Pitched up at 141 clicks, outside off, Milton Shumba\u00a0leans on and drives it crisply towards cover.", "Summary": {"Score": "12/2", "Over": "4", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "66036", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "2", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "67162", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "16", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "58065", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "1", "Runs": "3", "Wickets": "0", "Ball_bowled": "12", "Dot_balls": "10"}], "Balls": "24", "Current_runrate": "3.00", "Required_runrate": "5.69"}, "Timestamp": "2024-01-06T13:38:26+00:00", "Non_Striker": "67162", "Non_Striker_Name": "Takudzwanashe Kaitano", "Score": "12/2", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Ball_Speed": "141.0kph", "Ball_Number": "24", "Over_No": "4", "Ball": "6", "Ball_Line_Length": "24,8,10,11,41,19", "This_Over": "0,4(4B),0,1,2,0,", "Batsman_Details": {"Batsman": "66036", "Runs": "2", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, "Non_Striker_Details": {"Batsman": "67162", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "16", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, "Bowler_Details": {"Bowler": "58065", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "1", "Runs": "3", "Wickets": "0"}, "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "End_Over": true, "Default_Commentary": "3.6: Dushmantha Chameera to Milton Shumba, No run.", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.5", "Id": "26", "UID": 20026, "OID": 20026.0, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "8,330,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "58065", "Bowler_Name": "Dushmantha Chameera", "Batsman": "66036", "Batsman_Name": "Milton Shumba", "Batsman_Style": "L", "Commentary": "Sloppy! Hurls it on a good length, on middle and leg, Milton Shumba\u00a0gets half-forward and tucks it to the right of mid-wicket for a quick single. The fielder misses the shy at the non-striker's end and the throw is not backed up well at extra cover,\u00a0allowing an extra run.", "Timestamp": "2024-01-06T13:37:28+00:00", "Non_Striker": "67162", "Non_Striker_Name": "Takudzwanashe Kaitano", "Score": "12/2", "Batsman_Runs": "2", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": 